# ── randybuilds.tech — PROPOSED, NOT APPLIED ────────────────────────────────
# Paste above the catch-all `http:// { … }` block at the end of
# /mnt/nvme/unmaskd.app/infrastructure/compose/Caddyfile, only after Randy
# approves launch. Independent site: own container (randybuilds-tech), own
# network (randybuilds-edge), nothing shared with the unmaskd. blocks except
# the existing `trusted-peer-only` snippet (Cloudflare/tunnel peers only).
#
# Traffic path: visitor → Cloudflare (TLS) → cloudflared tunnel → Caddy :80
# (these http:// blocks) → randybuilds-tech:8080. No origin certificate is
# needed for this path. nginx in the container already sets CSP and the
# other security headers; HSTS is set here because only the edge knows the
# visitor arrived over HTTPS.
#
# To undo: delete these two blocks and `caddy reload`.

http://randybuilds.tech {
    import trusted-peer-only
    reverse_proxy randybuilds-tech:8080 {
        header_up -CF-Connecting-IP
        header_up -X-Real-IP
    }
    header {
        Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
        -Server
    }
    encode zstd gzip
}

http://www.randybuilds.tech {
    import trusted-peer-only
    redir https://randybuilds.tech{uri} permanent
}
